{
 "command": "secondary-window-supports",
 "notes": [
  "Feeds W8-18o (dialogs::secondary_window_port). Reflection over the internal Win32SecondaryWindowPort and SecondaryWindowRouter of the PhotoReview (Shell.Win32) assembly; no window is created, no dialog is shown.",
  "The port is built with an empty IServiceProvider (new ServiceCollection().BuildServiceProvider()) and settingsEnabled = () => true / () => false / null (default: SettingsPageCatalog.IsComplete). The router is built over that port with a null fallback.",
  "Output per kind: supports -> value (Win32SecondaryWindowPort.Supports(kind)); router_supports -> value (SecondaryWindowRouter.Supports(kind)); initial -> open_count (OpenCount), is_benchmark_open, settings_enabled_value (SettingsEnabled); kinds -> names (the SecondaryWindowKind names in declaration order) and values (their ints).",
  "The baseline enum has 8 members (no ExternalEditors / RenamePrompt: those are post-baseline, D-W8B5-415); the Rust enum has 2 more variants that the golden does not list."
 ],
